        {
          "name": "Search",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get Inventory",
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "apikey"
                },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "{{TRAVELOKA_TOKEN}}"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n//c48 => Jakarta; c122 => Surabaya; c103=> Malang; c73 => Semarang; c539=> Riau; c564 => Bali; c41 => Sumedang; c9 => Bandar Lampung\n  \"originCode\": \"c48\",\n  \"destinationCode\": \"c103\",\n  \"departureDate\": {\n    \"month\": 1,\n    \"day\": 10,\n    \"year\": 2025\n  },\n//   \"returnDate\": {\n//     \"month\": 10,\n//     \"day\": 21,\n//     \"year\": 2023\n//   },\n  \"numOfAdults\": 1\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{TRAVELOKA_URL_API}}/bus/get-inventories",
                  "host": [
                    "{{TRAVELOKA_URL_API}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "bus",
                    "get-inventories"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Provides the list of bus inventories from origin point to destination point.\n\n1. Set the return date for round trip.\n    \n2. You can search bus using both point code & city code.\n    \n3. The maximum number of adults is 4 pax.\n    \n4. UNAVAILABLE_ALREADY_PASSED_TTD status in inventory is the inventory that you can’t book anymore, TTD is Time to Departure so that you can’t booked bus that is leaving soon.\n    \n5. Fare represents bus counter price, if there's promotion we will give the promo price on fare and the oldFare will be filled with bus counter price.\n    \n6. BusAffiliationPAPISearchStatus:\n    \n    - _AVAILABLE_: There is available inventories from origin code and destination code.\n        \n    - _UNAVAILABLE_SUGGEST_BY_CITY_: There is no available inventories from origin code and destination code, but still available from origin city code and destination city code.\n        \n    - _UNAVAILABLE_SUGGEST_CONNECTING_: There is no available inventories from origin code and destination code, but still available from connecting bus.\n        \n    - _UNAVAILABLE_NO_ALTERNATIVES_: There is no available inventory from origin code and destination code."
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Seating",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Get Seat Map",
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "apikey"
                },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "{{TRAVELOKA_TOKEN}}",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n    \"routeId\": \"114059\",\n    \"skuId\": \"8838\",\n    \"providerId\": \"PTEKASARILORENA\",\n    \"providerName\": \"LORENA\",\n    \"pickUpPointCode\": \"p2\",\n    \"dropOffPointCode\": \"p67\",\n    \"departureDateTime\": {\n      \"specificDate\": {\n          \"monthDayYear\": {\n            \"month\": 1,\n            \"day\": 2025,\n            \"year\": 18\n          },\n          \"hourMinute\": {\n            \"hour\": 13,\n            \"minute\": 0\n          }\n        },\n      \"timeZoneId\": \"Asia/Jakarta\"\n    },\n    \"arrivalDateTime\": {\n      \"specificDate\": {\n          \"monthDayYear\": {\n            \"month\": 1,\n            \"day\": 2025,\n            \"year\": 19\n          },\n          \"hourMinute\": {\n            \"hour\": 3,\n            \"minute\": 15\n          }\n        },\n      \"timeZoneId\": \"Asia/Jakarta\"\n    },\n    \"numOfAdults\": 1\n  }",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{TRAVELOKA_URL_API}}/bus/get-seat-map",
                  "host": [
                    "{{TRAVELOKA_URL_API}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "bus",
                    "get-seat-map"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Provides bus seat map with available seat, if the bus provider provides the seat selection.\n\n1. The bus with more than one wagon is double decker bus\n2. **Grid Type:**\n    \n    - SEAT\n    - TOILET\n    - SMOKING_SPACE\n    - DRIVER\n    - EXIT\n    - OTHER_LABEL\n    - EMPTY\n    - UPWARD_STAIRS\n    - DOWNWARD_STAIRS\n        \n3. **Grid Status**:\n    \n    - AVAILABLE (if seat is available)\n        \n    - NOT_AVAILABLE_ANOTHER_SUBCLASS (if seat is not spec class)\n        \n    - NOT_AVAILABLE_TAKEN (if seat is already taken)\n        \n    - NOT_APPLICABLE (if not seat type)"
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Booking",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Booking",
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "{{TRAVELOKA_TOKEN}}"
